---
layout: base.njk
title: "Legal Insights | Business Law Guidance for Indian Companies"
description: "Practical legal guidance on corporate and business law, company compliance, IP protection, startup financing, employment law and dispute resolution for businesses and entrepreneurs in Delhi NCR and across India."
permalink: /legal-insights/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<section class="page-hero has-photo grain">
  <div class="ph-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521587760476-6c12a4b040da?w=1920&q=75&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="" loading="eager"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Legal Insights</p>
    <h1>Legal Insights</h1>
    <p>Practical legal guidance on corporate and business law, company compliance, intellectual property, startup financing, employment law and dispute resolution — for business owners and corporate legal counsel across Delhi NCR, Gurugram, Mumbai and India.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-tight">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="insight-grid reveal">
      {% for article in collections.legalInsights %}
      <a class="insight-card" href="{{ article.url }}">
        <div class="insight-img"><img src="{{ article.data.image }}" alt="{{ article.data.title }}" loading="lazy"><span class="insight-tag">{{ article.data.tag }}</span></div>
        <div class="insight-body">
          <h3>{{ article.data.title }}</h3>
          <div class="meta"><span>{{ article.data.readTime }}</span><span>{{ article.data.date | monthYear }}</span></div>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Free tools</p>
        <h2>Tools to help you in business and make informed decisions.</h2>
        <p>Our free calculators are designed to assist you in understanding the numbers, assessing your position and planning your next step.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/resources/" class="btn btn-outline sec-link">All Resources</a>
    </div>
    <div class="pa-grid reveal" style="grid-template-columns:repeat({{ tools.length }},1fr)">
      {% for tool in tools %}
      <a class="pa-card" href="{{ tool.url }}" data-bg="{{ tool.image }}">
        <span class="pa-card-img" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="pa-card-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div class="pa-card-body">
          <svg class="pa-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4">{{ tool.iconSvg | safe }}</svg>
          <h3>{{ tool.title }}</h3>
          <div class="pa-card-more"><p>{{ tool.desc }}</p></div>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band grain">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center">Have a question of your own?</p>
    <h2>We're happy to point you in the right direction, even before an engagement begins.</h2>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Ask a Question</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
